WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:06.080
The execution of the pirate king Gol D. Roger
and the execution of his son Portgas D. Ace.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.210
One happens right at the beginning of the
story sparking the great pirate era, the other

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:14.400
right in the middle, plunging the world into
an era of chaos and war.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.369
So wouldn’t it make sense, if there was
one final execution that would ring in an

00:00:18.369 --> 00:00:23.270
era of freedom and peace for the entire world,
near the end of One Piece as well?

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:27.539
And at this point in the story, there is only
one person, that the government is as desperate

00:00:27.539 --> 00:00:30.130
to execute as the first pirate king.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:35.120
Which leaves us with a super intriguing question:
What would happen, if Luffy was about to be

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.620
executed by the Marines?

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.250
Who would come to his rescue?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.120
And what would this second version of Marineford
look like?

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.059
Imagine this: It is some time after Luffy
has just defeated Kaido.

00:00:45.059 --> 00:00:50.120
He has officially been labeled a Yonko and
has awakened his legendary devil fruit.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:54.340
So you might be wondering, how would the world
government ever capture him?

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:58.180
Well, there are a few options of how this
could happen.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.320
He could be betrayed by one of his allies
or even be blackmailed if one of his friends

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.440
has been kidnapped.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:07.280
But for the sake of this video, let’s just
assume that someone has drugged his pile of

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:09.360
meat which knocks Luffy out cold.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:13.530
He is then carried away during the night and
onto a government ship.

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:19.600
Next they slap on their strongest sea prism
stone, submerge Luffy in a tank of water,

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.690
tie him down with chains, and keep him guarded
by an admiral and Seraphim.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:27.900
Certainly that should be enough to keep any
devil fruit user contained.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:32.720
And now that he’s captured, we have to ask
why would the World Government want to execute

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:34.119
Luffy in the first place?

00:01:34.119 --> 00:01:39.680
Well, to start, he has already publicly declared
war on the WG, he assaulted a world noble,

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:45.720
he is the son of Dragon, the most wanted man
in the world, and he is a Yonko with a 3 billion

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:46.820
berry bounty.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:50.969
On top of all that, executing Luffy would
be a symbol to the world that the government

00:01:50.969 --> 00:01:55.360
still owns the seas, just like they did with
Roger and Ace’s executions.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:02:00.009
And if that isn’t enough, they would definitely
want to eliminate the awakened Nika fruit

00:02:00.009 --> 00:02:03.750
user because of his ties to Joy Boy and the
void century.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:08.459
To sum it up, Luffy is the biggest current
threat to the World Government and their control

00:02:08.459 --> 00:02:09.459
of the world.

00:02:09.459 --> 00:02:14.990
So with Luffy on a ship heading to New Marineford,
where they plan to carry out the execution,

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:19.170
the World Government announces to the world
that Luffy will be put to death in a few days

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:20.170
time.

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:24.790
Now you might be wondering why in the world
they would choose a public execution AGAIN

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.190
after they almost lost the war at Marineford.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:29.110
Well, it is really quite simple.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:34.160
You see, a public execution is about more
than just killing someone, it is a symbol

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.099
of power and control.

00:02:36.099 --> 00:02:40.430
So by executing Luffy with the whole world
watching, the world government is sending

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:46.040
a message to all pirates that no matter how
strong you are, the world government cannot

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.050
be defeated.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:52.570
As for why they choose New Marineford as the
location, you will see exactly why they choose

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:55.120
this spot later in the video.

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.810
But first, what about the other straw hats?

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.599
Well, while they are strong, they aren’t
powerful enough to take on the entire of the

00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:05.470
marine forces and rescue Luffy by themselves.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:10.160
Instead, they immediately try to contact as
many of their friends as possible and tell

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.849
them that Luffy needs their help.

00:03:11.849 --> 00:03:13.819
And by friends, we mean ALL OF THEIR FRIENDS.

00:03:13.819 --> 00:03:14.819
[show most of the chibi’s, perhaps some
of the more uncertain allies silhouetted]

00:03:14.819 --> 00:03:16.620
A pretty impressive group.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:20.480
Are the marines seriously even going to stand
a chance?

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:26.470
Well, the marines have many impressive fighters
themselves plus the new Seraphim, who are

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:30.390
advanced clones of the former Warlords, that
we were introduced to right after Wano.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.390
[show chibi’s of the marines, in order like
a pyramid.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.390
Vice-admirals.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:33.390
Seraphim.

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:34.390
Admirals.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.390
Kong and Gorosei on top.

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:36.390
Imu above them?]

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:37.390
But while most characters can be clearly divided
into either allies or enemies, there are many

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:38.390
that have uncertain loyalties.

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:42.810
For example, what would Garp do if Luffy was
about to be executed?

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:47.739
We already saw that he could barely contain
himself when Ace was killed, so would he really

00:03:47.739 --> 00:03:51.000
stand by and let his last remaining grandson
die?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.439
And how about Koby, Smoker, or even Fujitora?

00:03:54.439 --> 00:03:56.870
How will they behave on the battlefield?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:01.810
And speaking of said battlefield, here is
what we know about New Marineford.

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:05.540
This base became the new headquarters after
old marineford was destroyed.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:06.540
[show map].

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:10.010
It has this massive, many-tiered fortress
surrounded by rocky land.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:15.030
There are also these huge mcdonalds-shaped
arches and a bridge possibly leading to the

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:16.030
Red Line.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.540
The execution platform with Luffy is right
here [mark him on the second tier above the

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.199
gate] guarded by Akainu, Garp and Sengoku.

00:04:21.199 --> 00:04:26.820
Most of the marine forces are spread out around
the island, including the Seraphim and Vice-Admirals,

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:30.930
while the admirals wait right here above the
main gate.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:36.430
And at the top of the structure, Kong makes
his first real appearance to oversee the battle.

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:38.240
And let’s get to that battle.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:40.640
It is a few days after Luffy was captured.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:45.539
And with the world watching, the Thousand
Sunny approaches New Marineford.

00:04:45.539 --> 00:04:49.900
The straw hats and Sabo, who they picked up
along the way, are lined up at the front of

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.520
the ship, determined to save Luffy.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:56.729
But they are immediately fired upon by every
single cannon on the fortress.

00:04:56.729 --> 00:05:01.669
Zoro and Sanji leap up and protect the ship
and in return Franky fires the Gaon Cannon

00:05:01.669 --> 00:05:03.030
straight at the admirals.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.509
However, just like in Marineford, they block
the blast.

00:05:06.509 --> 00:05:13.280
And before the Sunny can even land, Greenbull
sends out a ton of vines to trap the ship.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:19.040
Sabo use his flame fruit powers to burn the
vines and those two begin the battle.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:24.750
The straw hats emerge from the ship and are
immediately met by S-Hawk and S-Flamingo.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.919
Zoro and Sanji take on these Seraphim, while
the other straw hats begin to fight the vice

00:05:28.919 --> 00:05:31.889
admirals and Seraphim as they make their way
towards Luffy.

00:05:31.889 --> 00:05:32.889
[show straw hats beginning to separate.]

00:05:32.889 --> 00:05:35.289
And remember that they are not alone in this
fight.

00:05:35.289 --> 00:05:39.850
Prior to the battle, the Straw Hats and the
Grand Fleet gathered to make a coordinated

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.060
plan of attack.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:46.030
And now that the Sunny has landed, the allied
captains join the battle, spreading out to

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:49.060
take on the other main forces of the marines.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:54.150
The battle is fully on, however, the marines
seem to have the upper hand.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.199
Cannons rain down on the grand fleet.

00:05:56.199 --> 00:05:58.030
The seraphim blast allies with lasers.

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:02.020
And all Luffy can do is shout encouragement
and curse the marines.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:06.870
And with the allies struggling to make progress,
the marines spring their first trap.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:09.901
Akainu literally erupts into these massive
streams of magma.

00:06:09.901 --> 00:06:15.550
The magma lands in three lines around the
island, basically separating the fighters

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:16.690
from each other.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:20.270
And here’s where I’ll add that even though
we don’t exactly know how these fights would

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:24.810
go, we can reasonably guess how close characters
are in strength.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:29.510
So while it is possible the allies would be
destroyed, we will assume they are strong

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:32.210
enough to survive… for now.

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:36.610
With the fighters trapped between the magma
and the superheated air above it, the admirals

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:41.850
leap down into each sector and begin the lay
waste to the allies.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:46.970
Akainu sees that Greenbull’s plants are
no match for Sabo and he swaps places with

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.540
the forest Logia user.

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:53.250
Instead, Greenbull enters the sector where
Zoro, Sanji, and Usopp are fighting S-Hawk

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.330
and S-Flamingo.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:58.780
And while Zoro and Sanji are occupied with
the Seraphim, Usopp is left to run for his

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.410
life from the admiral.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.889
It’s like he is reliving his worst nightmare
[show training in the forest during the timeskip].

00:07:02.889 --> 00:07:07.050
On the other side of the island, Fujitora
seems to be more concerned with saving lives

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:10.319
than he is with attacking Nami, Franky and
Chopper.

00:07:10.319 --> 00:07:14.490
Although those three do have to contend with
S-Shark and S-Croc.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:19.280
No easy feat, although Franky as already fought
against S-Sharks’ Swim-Swim fruit during

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.530
his battle of chads with Senor Pink.

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:27.120
This leaves Kizaru free to zip around and
unleash light bombs all around the battlefield.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:30.550
Yeah, things are not looking good for the
straw hats.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:34.220
But thankfully, there are more allies on the
way.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:39.520
Suddenly, a massive blast breath shoots out
of the clouds, destroying all of the cannons

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.370
on one side of the fortress.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:46.670
It seems the pink dragon Momo and Kaido’s
son/daughter were a little late to the battle

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.600
after picking up Marco the Phoenix.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:53.440
And while these three are powerhouses by themselves,
it seems that the Samurai of Wano have stayed

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.289
home to protect their island.

00:07:55.289 --> 00:08:00.120
Regardless, Momo continues to blast the fortress
until Kizaru comes to confront them.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:04.930
And while Momo is a large target for the light
Logia user, Yamato and Marco do enough to

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:09.600
keep the admiral at bay while Momo destroys
all of the cannons.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:16.470
Meanwhile, Kong jumps down next to Luffy,
who is cursing at his Grandpa to let him go.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:21.900
Because he knows that the way things are going,
his crew and fleet will not survive.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:26.430
While Zoro and Sanji can fight on par with
the Seraphim, the other straw hats simply

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:27.970
can’t hold out forever.

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:32.849
Robin and Brook combine to fight the shadow
powers of S-Gecko, while Jinbe combines his

00:08:32.849 --> 00:08:36.729
Fishman Karate and the nearby water to fight
against S-Snake.

00:08:36.729 --> 00:08:40.769
While on the other side of the island, Nami,
Franky, and Chopper have to fight gravity

00:08:40.769 --> 00:08:43.740
and the superhuman strength of S-Croc and
S-Shark.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:47.810
Meanwhile, the Grand fleet is fighting with
the Vice-Admirals Hina, Smoker, Bastille,

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:52.910
Doberman, and Lonz, and they can’t do much
else to help.

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:56.940
In fact, things are about to get much worse.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:02.190
Akainu momentarily overwhelms Sabo with his
superior magma powers, and Luffy’s brother

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:03.770
is thrown near the sea.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:09.060
Just like in Marineford, Jinbe steps up to
stop Akainu, but he is no match for the admiral.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:12.080
With Jinbe distracted, S-Snake is free to
hunt Robin.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:17.200
The Seraphim brushes aside Robin’s sprouted
limbs and grabs the archaeologist by the throat,

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.810
choking the life out of her.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:22.240
Brook tries to save her, but he is stopped
by S-Gecko.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:27.649
Robin even tries to enter her demon form,
but S-Snake is just too strong.

00:09:27.649 --> 00:09:32.480
However, one marine can no longer just stand
by and watch.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:38.190
Flying in with a flash of pink hair, Koby
punches S-Snake, sending her crashing to the

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:39.190
rocks.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:41.930
And our favorite archeologist is free.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:47.070
Meanwhile, Koby is literally shaking, unsure
of what to do next.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:49.360
Furious, Akainu comes for Koby.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:54.480
And the pink haired marine refuses to cower
as he did at Marineford.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:10:01.269
However, as Akainu reaches back his fiery
fist, he is blasted by a huge gust of wind.

00:10:01.269 --> 00:10:07.550
Everyone on this side of the island stops,
stunned as they see Monkey D. Dragon and the

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:10.430
revolutionary army standing on top of the
bridge.

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:15.590
And while we don’t know exactly what Dragons
powers are, everytime we have seen him in

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:18.670
the story there is strange wind and weather.

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:23.820
So for now let’s assume he has some sort
of wind powers, either from a devil fruit

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:24.959
or an ancient weapon.

00:10:24.959 --> 00:10:29.470
Or maybe just the most over powered wind dial
in history ***chuckles**.*

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:34.700
As Dragon looks down on the field, he sends
another blast of wind that almost topples

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.700
Akainu.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:40.660
This gives Sabo enough time to get some healing
from the Tontatta princess Mansherry so he

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.860
can get back up and resume his fight with
the fleet admiral.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:50.080
Meanwhile, Dragon stares at Luffy for a long
moment, but instead of coming to save him,

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:54.670
he turns and makes his way across the bridge
towards the Red Line and Mariejois.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:59.920
It seems that Dragon sees this chaos as the
opportune moment to fulfill his own plans

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.149
of taking down the celestial dragons.

00:11:02.149 --> 00:11:04.930
However, he will not get there so easily.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:09.310
Because this whole time, the Gorosei have
been watching the battle ready to intervene

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.370
if necessary.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:17.010
And now they see a chance to end one of the
most dangerous threats to the world government,

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.700
and they intend to take it.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:23.610
And again, we don’t really know the Gorosei’s
full capabilities yet, but for this video

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:27.440
we are going to assume that they have some
fighting capabilities.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:32.020
So along with CP0, they begin their battle
with the Revolutionaries.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:37.459
Now up in the air, Kizaru is finally getting
the better of Momo, Yamato, and Marco.

00:11:37.459 --> 00:11:42.010
Momo is burned from multiple light blasts,
and Marco is struggling to keep up with the

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.060
light fruit user.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:49.269
The Grand fleet is being overwhelmed by the
sheer number of vice-admirals and marines.

00:11:49.269 --> 00:11:55.000
And while Sanji has defeated S-Flamingo with
his super speed and fiery kicks, Zoro is still

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.260
locked in battle with S-Hawk.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:03.450
And poor Usopp is just barely staying alive
while running and sniping at Greenbull.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:07.079
Luckily, the straw hats' most powerful allies
are about to arrive.

00:12:07.079 --> 00:12:10.050
Buggy the Clown is ready to join the battle.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:14.100
And while it seems Buggy got a bit lost on
the way to New Marineford, he now stands at

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:19.260
the front of his massive ship giving a passionate
speech about how Cross Guild have come to

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:21.380
take out some marines of their own.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:26.820
This riles up his men, but while he is distracted,
Kizaru sends a laser shot right towards the

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:28.210
newly crowned Yonko.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:33.610
Unable to react in time, Buggy is saved by
the sword of his long time friend, Shanks.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:36.269
Welcome to the party, Red-Haired Pirates.

00:12:36.269 --> 00:12:41.899
Shanks leaps onto the battlefield followed
by his crew, Hancock, Rayleigh, as well as

00:12:41.899 --> 00:12:46.980
Crocodile and Mihawk, who have come with Buggy.

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:51.540
Shanks immediately heads towards the bridge
where the Revolutionaries are being overrun.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:55.899
Surely he is going to help Dragon against
the Gorosei, right?

00:12:55.899 --> 00:12:56.899
Right???

00:12:56.899 --> 00:13:02.110
At the same time, Mihawk begins to fight his
clone which frees Zoro to save Usopp from

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:03.110
Greenbull.

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:07.240
Likewise, Crocodile takes on S-Croc while
Rayleigh and Hancock take over fighting the

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:10.070
Seraphim attacking Robin and Brook.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:15.079
Up on the fortress, Luffy is thrilled to see
so many of his friends coming to help his

00:13:15.079 --> 00:13:18.580
crew, while Garp smolders watching the battlefield
below.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:26.070
But it is at this point, Kong has seen enough
and he orders Luffy’s immediate execution.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:31.070
As the announcement spreads across the field,
the straw hats become frantic.

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:34.540
Sanji tries to come help, but Kizaru keeps
him away.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.440
Franky launches a laser beam, but it is easily
blocked by S-Bear.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:43.459
Zoro manages to defeat Greenbull and leaps
up to the first wall, but he is stopped by

00:13:43.459 --> 00:13:45.269
the golden buddha Sengoku.

00:13:45.269 --> 00:13:49.990
But now that Usopp is not running for his
life, he climbs a rock and snipes Kong.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:55.970
However, the Commander in Chief easily tanks
Usopp’s shot.

00:13:55.970 --> 00:14:00.691
The executioner’s blades begin to fall,
but Shanks unleashes a Conqueror’s Haki

00:14:00.691 --> 00:14:03.760
blast that shakes the island.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.830
Weak characters from both sides fall.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:13.190
And it is more than enough to knock out the
executioners, who always seem to be these

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:15.850
random dudes **amused tone**.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:22.300
However, Kong snatches one of the blades and
is about to bring it down on Luffy’s neck.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:28.699
But unlike at Marineford, Garp isn’t going
to just stand by and watch.

00:14:28.699 --> 00:14:36.009
Garp crushes the blade in a haki covered fist,
and the most epic clash of marines begins.

00:14:36.009 --> 00:14:41.930
And while we don’t know exactly how strong
Kong is, we are going to assume that he should

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:45.600
be at least a match for Garp.

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:52.600
They throw island-shaking punches, crushing
stone beneath their feet, but eventually Garp’s

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:58.870
intense motivation to save his grandson helps
him win this brawl, and he throws Kong down

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.810
to the foot of the bridge.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:06.050
While all this is happening, Akainu has yet
again overwhelmed Sabo and Koby.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.840
This man is just too strong.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.110
The fleet admiral heads towards Garp and Luffy.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:15.709
Also, strangely the Gorosei and Kong are retreating
to the Red Line, leaving CP0 to fight the

00:15:15.709 --> 00:15:16.709
revolutionaries.

00:15:16.709 --> 00:15:22.579
This frees Shanks to confront Akainu and the
two begin the fight we never got to see at

00:15:22.579 --> 00:15:23.579
Marineford.

00:15:23.579 --> 00:15:27.850
On the other side of the battlefield, Momo
and Yamato have come to help fight Fujitora,

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:33.670
but the blind admiral has become even more
disinterested in fighting and is looking up

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:35.320
into the sky instead.

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:37.120
What could he sense up there?

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:41.180
Now with Kong defeated, Luffy yells for his
grandpa to set him free.

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:46.050
But instead Garp begins to lecture Luffy about
his choice to become a pirate and how he’s

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.500
put all of his friends at risk.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:52.970
After voicing his frustrations, Garp reaches
down to unlock the sea prism stone chains.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:59.170
However, as he does, blood spurts from his
mouth and a sinister laugh echoes across the

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:00.170
battlefield.

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:01.170
[Blackbeard Laughter]

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:06.800
Luffy shouts in shock as his grandpa topples
over, and suddenly three men become visible

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.829
beside the execution platform.

00:16:08.829 --> 00:16:15.759
They are Shiryu with his blade dripping blood,
Van Auger – who has the teleportation devil

00:16:15.759 --> 00:16:17.520
fruit – and Blackbeard.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:21.130
Garp coughs blood again, and tries to rise.

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:22.560
But it is too late.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:27.370
Before the vice-admiral can stand, Blackbeard
takes his pistol and shoots him in the back

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:29.310
over and over again.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:34.870
This happens right in front of Luffy, until
Garp’s eyes close and he lays still.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:36.709
Luffy’s eyes waver.

00:16:36.709 --> 00:16:39.370
His hair flashes white.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:44.709
Conqueror’s haki shoots from him like lightning
and the walls tremble.

00:16:44.709 --> 00:16:50.029
Suddenly a golden fist descends on the four
pirates as Sengoku roars with rage.

00:16:50.029 --> 00:16:54.380
Blackbeard blocks Sengoku’s giant punch
and with his other hand sends out shockwaves

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:57.029
that make the former fleet admiral fall.

00:16:57.029 --> 00:17:02.180
Zoro also leaps up and clashes with Shiryu
but Van Auger teleports the three of them

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:06.490
to the other side of the battlefield, leaving
Blackbeard and Luffy alone.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:12.120
Shouts rise from the battlefield as all eyes
are locked on the two pirate king rivals.

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:17.020
Blackbeard’s darkness-covered fist reaches
down and grabs Luffy by the neck.

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:21.530
Luffy thrashes, trying to break free, but
it is impossible due to Blackbeard’s fruit

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.980
and the seastone still weakening him.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:28.720
Blackbeard takes his pistol, points it at
Luffy’s head, but before he can pull the

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:31.700
trigger, the sky darkens.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:35.669
Blackbeard stops and looks up, as does everyone
else.

00:17:35.669 --> 00:17:41.070
Dark clouds have gathered, but above them
there is some incredible mass of light.

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:45.000
With everyone distracted, God Usopp takes
advantage of the moment.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:49.750
You see, the wax man Mr. 3 has also arrived
with Cross Guild.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:55.250
And just like in Marineford, he makes a key
to unlock the sea prism stone handcuffs.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:18:01.200
Usopp snipes the key all the way across the
battlefield perfectly into the slot on Luffy’s

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.520
handcuffs as he is held up by Blackbeard.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:04.520
[Click]

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.520
And Luffy is free.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:06.980
***say slowly with emphasis***

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:11.169
Just in time for beams of light to rain down
from the sky.

00:18:11.169 --> 00:18:14.309
You see, this was part of the plan all along.

00:18:14.309 --> 00:18:19.270
In a situation like this, it would be the
perfect moment for the Gorosei or Imu to use

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:23.200
their super powered weapon capable of destroying
islands.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:28.640
And the reason they wanted this execution
out in the open just like Marineford was to

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:35.070
gather all the strong pirates of the world,
and wipe them out all at once, even if they

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:38.380
killed many of the marines in the process.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:43.289
Effectively starting the great cleansing they
mentioned in chapter 908.

00:18:43.289 --> 00:18:48.320
And at this point, there are many ways such
an event could go.

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:53.669
The lasers could certainly be strong enough
to kill everyone gathered at New Marineford.

00:18:53.669 --> 00:18:58.790
But for this video, we are going to assume
that there is a way to survive.

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:02.049
Enter the enraged Sun god Luffy.

00:19:02.049 --> 00:19:07.880
Now fully in his awakened form, Luffy grabs
part of the fortress walls and stretches it

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:12.299
across the sky above the island just as the
lasers come down.

00:19:12.299 --> 00:19:16.820
The wall gets obliterated, but it does stop&nbsp;
the lasers.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:22.510
Rubble falls, destroying the island and many
of the pirates’ ships waiting in the ocean.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:26.800
Even the massive arches of new marineford
begin to crash to the ground.

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:31.980
It is pure chaos until suddenly the rocks
freeze in mid air.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:38.559
You see, Fujitora has fully abandoned the
fight and is using his gravity powers to stop

00:19:38.559 --> 00:19:40.179
the falling stones.

00:19:40.179 --> 00:19:44.400
And at this point survival is on everyone’s
mind.

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:49.600
Can you imagine seeing such destructive powers
nearly wipe everyone out.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:52.500
Who wouldn’t want to run?

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:56.650
Members of the grand fleet return to the ships
that are still intact.

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.470
The revolutionaries do the same.

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:02.520
Even the Red-Hair pirates are rallying around
Shanks near the shore.

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:07.750
Everyone just wants to escape with their lives
as this terrifying power lights up the sky

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.260
once more.

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:12.280
Well, everyone except Luffy.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:17.049
Laughing uncontrollably – and with tears
in his eyes – he protects Garp’s body

00:20:17.049 --> 00:20:21.909
from the falling stones and lashes out at
Blackbeard.

00:20:21.909 --> 00:20:28.000
The punch sends Blackbeard flying, but the
Yonko is caught by VanAuger and brought safely

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:29.370
to the ground.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:35.350
Luffy chases Blackbeard and this brings him
close to where Shanks and Akainu have paused

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.530
their fight.

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:41.670
Luffy and Blackbeard clash once again, shaking
the island with their titanic powers.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:44.550
Nearby, Shanks yells at Luffy to stop fighting.

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:48.809
And even Akainu is looking up at the sky as
he moves towards the bridge and the safety

00:20:48.809 --> 00:20:51.170
of the Red Line with the rest of the marines.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:52.170
[move the marines on the map]

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:57.559
But Luffy continues to pummel Blackbeard until
he is once again teleported by VanAuger out

00:20:57.559 --> 00:20:59.790
to their ship waiting offshore.

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:06.460
Luffy roars in frustration, and starts looking
around for someone else to fight.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:12.740
He moves towards Akainu, seeking revenge for
Ace, just as the beams of light fall again,

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:17.500
but he is halted as a scream cuts across the
battlefield.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:22.690
Back near the Sunny, a laser blast has fallen
near the gathered straw hats.

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:28.120
Smoke fills the air, and Luffy can see Sanji
holding an unconscious Nami, dodging between

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:32.610
strikes of light as the crew retreats to the
Sunny.

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:37.059
Suddenly, Luffy snaps out of his battle rage.

00:21:37.059 --> 00:21:39.410
Usopp shouts at Luffy to come back.

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:42.700
And Zoro leaps down from the fortress carrying
Garp’s body.

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:49.150
Luffy takes another look towards the Red Line
and once again declares war on the world government.

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:56.650
Luffy shares a look with Shanks and then departs,
picking up Usopp as they return to the Sunny

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:57.789
and escape.

00:21:57.789 --> 00:22:01.440
But this is far from the final battle.

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:06.279
Now that Luffy has even more motivation to
come after the world government, he and Akainu

00:22:06.279 --> 00:22:12.730
are guaranteed to clash one final time, which
might well be the hardest battle for Luffy

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:14.059
in the entire story.

00:22:14.059 --> 00:22:19.240
That’s because as we just saw in this battle,
the fleet admiral has one of the most overpowered

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:20.610
devil fruits in One Piece.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:26.150
In fact, all of the admirals have ridiculously
strong devil fruits, which actually leaves

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:31.600
us with another super interesting question:
what do you think would have happened if instead

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:36.270
of his own devil fruit, Luffy had eaten one
of the admirals’ fruits?

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:40.080
And you can watch that video right here.

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:40.760
Shanks for watching.

